        "Content": "A three bedroom semi detached house situated in a compact well maintained cul de sac development within walking distance of the amenities of the village of Kerrykeel. The property is well located as a base for a holiday home or as a family home. \n\nAccommodation\n\nHallway\n4.80m x 2.00m Tiled floor, understairs storage\n\nLounge\n5.20m x 3.80m Fireplace with wooden surround and tiled hearth, T.V. point, tiled flooring, cornice to ceiling\n\nKitchen/Dining\n4.60m x 4.20m Fitted kitchen with eye and low level units, tiled above work surfaces, electric oven and hob, integrated dishwasher, fridge freezer, tiled floor, sliding doors to garden\n\nUtility Room\n2.00m x 1.60m Fitted unit, plumbed for washing machine, back door\n\nWC\n1.60m x 1.60m W.C., W.H.B., tiled floor\n\nBedroom 1\n3.80m x 3.60m Front facing\n\nEn-suite\n1.70m x 1.30m W.C., W.H.B., electric shower\n\nBedroom 2\n3.60m x 3.50m Rear facing\n\nBedroom 3\n3.30m x 2.60m Rear facing\n\nBathroom\n3.30m x 2.60m W.C., W.H.B., and shower\n\n\nOutside\nLow maintenance stoned garden with feature seat Fenced boundary Driveway to front"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Small cul-de-sac development within walking distance of the village\nLow maintenance stoned garden with feature seat\nFenced boundary\nDriveway to front\nFloored loft for storage with stair access\n\n \n O.F.C.H Mains Water & Sewage \n Kerrykeel is a small village on the shores of Mulroy Bay with several small independent shops, post office, National school, restaurants and bars. The village is a popular summer holiday location with its proximity to many quality beaches nearby in Portsalon, Fanad and Rathmullan"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER Number: 100907120, Energy Performance Indicator: 225.0kWh/m²/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Kerrykeel, take the road for Rathmullan. Turn left and proceed for approximately 200m. Turn right into Cuan Na Tra and follow road. House is located on the left. Enter Eircode F92 VX96 into Sat Nav or Smartphone to be taken to the property"
      }
